<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.key.mints ~ the hand adopts the pin the founding act signed, and the stage stands

`kahua mint` adopts the kahua pin the face's founding act signed, by whichever device founds the face, and registers it, so the face's stage stands for every device it wears. A face whose signed log names no pin refuses `kahua-mint-outside-founding`: the pin comes from the founding act alone, and the door mints none of its own.

The act signs under the face's root out of sealed custody, so a person at a real terminal runs it; an AI seat names the command for the operator. Every answer prints as JSON.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ the-worn-pin · a-named-face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-worn-pin` params=`~ adopt the pin on the one face standing open`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`a-named-face` params=`face/1 ~ adopt the pin of one named face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ which face's stage this call reads or writes, by persona index (a whole number from 0); absent, the one face standing open or the worn face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the lōkahi cap and the grant come out of sealed custody and the act signs under the face's root; a person runs it at their own terminal, and an AI seat names the command`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ kahua-mint-outside-founding · face-malformed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`kahua-mint-outside-founding` params=`cure/[[face.key.mints face/1]] ~ the face's log names no pin: mint rides the founding act's own pin, and a face that never signed one has none to adopt`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.key.mints face/1]] ~ --face names a persona index, a whole number from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ minted · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`minted` params=`exit/0 ~ the pin stands registered; the door's answer prints as JSON`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ the door refused by name; the line carries its reason`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares kahua mint

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`spells/[[lares kahua mint]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

